        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Katherine Bailess, James LaRosa, Bette Midler, Brooke Shields, Britney Spears, Madonna, *NSYNC, Jason Samuels Smith, Almamy, Elizabeth Berkley\n- TV Series: One Tree Hill, Gilmore Girls, Hit the Floor, Bounce\n- Organizations: The CW, VH1, Broadway Dance Center\n- Roles: Erica Marsh, Stephanie, Kyle Hart\n\nFacts:\n- Katherine Bailess was born on April 24, 1980.\n- Katherine Bailess is an American actress, singer, and dancer.\n- Katherine Bailess is best known for playing Erica Marsh on The CW show One Tree Hill.\n- Katherine Bailess played Stephanie, a Life and Death Brigade member, on Gilmore Girls.\n- Katherine Bailess played Kyle Hart on the VH1 series Hit the Floor.\n- Hit the Floor was originally titled Bounce.\n- Hit the Floor is an American sports drama television series on VH1.\n- Hit the Floor was created by James LaRosa.\n- Katherine Bailess has taken class or rehearsed at Broadway Dance Center.\n- Bette Midler, Brooke Shields, Britney Spears, Madonna, *NSYNC, Jason Samuels Smith, Almamy, and Elizabeth Berkley have taken class or rehearsed at Broadway Dance Center.\n- Many Broadway performers take class daily at Broadway Dance Center.",
